                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bed48274-2a15-38c0-828d-1e6872b5499d",
                        "entry_id": "2ff9b4f7-efdb-361c-8048-4b4b189e0780",
                        "glosses": [
                            "chlorek rtęci(I), biała, słabo rozpuszczalna w wodzie substancja używana m.in. jako środek antyseptyczny lub przeczyszczający"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21d1e6c4-d281-40bf-8458-6c8ac152dc32",
                                "sense_id": "bed48274-2a15-38c0-828d-1e6872b5499d",
                                "text": "Wysypał odważony kalomel, przetarł talerzyki metalowe i po raz drugi nadważył… Dopiero za czwartym razem wagę utrafił."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "979093ea-0642-45aa-8121-4f65d2990054",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ff9b4f7-efdb-361c-8048-4b4b189e0780",
                        "source_sense_id": "bed48274-2a15-38c0-828d-1e6872b5499d",
                        "target_lang_word": "calomel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "calomel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "986df13d-32ec-3493-8c54-18c624aae990",
                                        "entry_id": "f0f520b8-3ce7-3e06-8757-e94d7f41299d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mercurous chloride Hg₂Cl₂, formerly used as a laxative and disinfectant and to treat syphilis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29f73b91-9f5d-4876-8604-034bd75e711d",
                                                "sense_id": "986df13d-32ec-3493-8c54-18c624aae990",
                                                "text": "What a pity there is not some mental calomel! for Mr. Lushington's equanimity was in a bilious fever with Edward Lorraine's appearance of luxurious enjoyment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8ff9e2d-39a4-44a4-8539-1647fdf29f80",
                                                "sense_id": "986df13d-32ec-3493-8c54-18c624aae990",
                                                "text": "“Where am I?” said the little spectre, in a pathetic voice. “And why was I born in the Calomel days, and why did I have all that Calomel given me?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d41f809-111e-443c-bdec-55b2d35b1950",
                                                "sense_id": "986df13d-32ec-3493-8c54-18c624aae990",
                                                "text": "He is remembered for his free use of calomel and the lancet. Mrs. Jane Merrill Ketcham, one of his patients in her childhood, says “it is no exaggeration to say that his pills were as large as cherries; twenty grains of calomel was a common dose and antimony until one was sure he was poisoned.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a530ee9-86b3-4e83-a294-541a0930be90",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ff9b4f7-efdb-361c-8048-4b4b189e0780",
                        "source_sense_id": "bed48274-2a15-38c0-828d-1e6872b5499d",
                        "target_lang_word": "kalomel",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc60c48e-7e47-4fec-963a-34ce3882f10f",
                        "source_entry_id": "2ff9b4f7-efdb-361c-8048-4b4b189e0780",
                        "source_sense_id": "bed48274-2a15-38c0-828d-1e6872b5499d",
                        "target_lang_word": "calomel",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "calomel",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "718500f1-f2f1-3c7e-ba8b-ccc470695c5e",
                                        "entry_id": "16bda249-d67d-30ba-b20b-56b8a90dbd87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ancien nom du protochlorure de mercure sublimé, encore usité en termes de pharmacie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a4644bf-e410-42bb-8e5e-5345b08f7c09",
                                                "sense_id": "718500f1-f2f1-3c7e-ba8b-ccc470695c5e",
                                                "text": "Dans les doses permises et malgré l’effroi du mercure ils administrèrent du calomel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c43b1ed3-0087-470d-ab2b-9a67b17ca27f",
                                                "sense_id": "718500f1-f2f1-3c7e-ba8b-ccc470695c5e",
                                                "text": "Reprenons nos esprits, et de ce rhum qui, je vous en fiche mon billet, vaut tous les calomels du monde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a89552bb-f7e1-47ed-b4ca-42f18039f816",
                                                "sense_id": "718500f1-f2f1-3c7e-ba8b-ccc470695c5e",
                                                "text": "Le chlorure mercureux Hg₂Cl₂, sel connu depuis longtemps sous les noms de dragon mitigé, de mercure sublimé doux et surtout de calomel, existe, comme nous le savons, à l'état naturel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e06e564f-2e5c-453b-a990-849288dd6a0b",
                                                "sense_id": "718500f1-f2f1-3c7e-ba8b-ccc470695c5e",
                                                "text": "Ce n’est pas de la confiture de fraises… Il m’observe, il hésite un instant et il dit : « C’était bien de la confiture de fraises, mais ce que tu y voyais, c’était un peu de calomel. On l’avait mélangé avec elle, on espérait que tu ne t’apercevrais de rien, je sais que tu détestes le calomel, mais il faut absolument que tu en prennes… »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1613a56-aa01-4f6d-8851-2b9ed7d92816",
                                                "sense_id": "718500f1-f2f1-3c7e-ba8b-ccc470695c5e",
                                                "text": "Une combinaison d’électrodes qu’on pourrait utiliser pour déterminer le pH est constituée par une électrode à hydrogène reliée par un pont salin à une électrode au calomel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
